Ahretahû

23.08.2001

..(09.44) ..

Karşıyaka', '......................................................Allah C.C diyor ki: ......................................................Fikirsiz, Zi...', ARRAY['Türk Edebiyatı','Şiir','Ahmet Refik Tavşanlı']::text[], 8.5, '{"poet":"Ahmet Refik Tavşanlı","poet_slug":"ahmet-refik-tavsanli","theme":"Türk Şiiri","is_hero":false,"total_lines":13,"source_url":"https://www.antoloji.com/suretin-insan-2-siiri/"}'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;
